  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_01",
      "hash64": "4A602E61B3DEF66A",
      "text": "你好呀，我来告诉你\\n宝可梦的尺寸怎么样？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_02",
      "hash64": "4A602D61B3DEF4B7",
      "text": "你想知道哪只\\n宝可梦的尺寸呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_03",
      "hash64": "4A602C61B3DEF304",
      "text": "你的[VAR 0x0102(0001)]，\\n嗯，我看看……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0102",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_04",
      "hash64": "4A602B61B3DEF151",
      "text": "这只宝可梦真big啊！！！！\\c\\n这么大的宝可梦，\\n实在非常罕见哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_05",
      "hash64": "4A602A61B3DEEF9E",
      "text": "它一定是全世界最大的\\n[VAR 0x0101(0001)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_06",
      "hash64": "4A602961B3DEEDEB",
      "text": "哎呀！好大的宝可梦！\\n可以扑通一下靠在它的背上，\\r\\n令人十分安心哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_07",
      "hash64": "4A602861B3DEEC38",
      "text": "嘻嘻！它似乎比一般的\\n宝可梦大很多呢！\\r\\n要珍惜这个特点哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_08",
      "hash64": "4A602761B3DEEA85",
      "text": "它似乎比一般的宝可梦\\n稍微大一点点呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_09",
      "hash64": "4A602661B3DEE8D2",
      "text": "标准至极！\\n它平均水准的尺寸，\\r\\n充满了正统派的魅力哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_10",
      "hash64": "4A5CA961B3DBDE94",
      "text": "它似乎比一般的宝可梦\\n稍微小一点点呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_11",
      "hash64": "4A5CAA61B3DBE047",
      "text": "嘻嘻！它似乎比一般的\\n宝可梦小很多！\\r\\n要珍惜这个特点哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_12",
      "hash64": "4A5CAB61B3DBE1FA",
      "text": "哎呀！好小的宝可梦！\\n[VAR 0x0101(0001)]界的小小偶像！\\r\\n它实在是太可爱了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_13",
      "hash64": "4A5CAC61B3DBE3AD",
      "text": "这只宝可梦真small啊！！！！\\c\\n这么小的宝可梦，\\n实在非常罕见哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_14",
      "hash64": "4A5CA561B3DBD7C8",
      "text": "它一定是全世界最小的\\n[VAR 0x0101(0001)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
