      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_17",
      "hash64": "4A5CA861B3DBDCE1",
      "text": "你要是想知道宝可梦的尺寸，\\n随时来找我哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sub_035_mgirl_18",
      "hash64": "4A5CA161B3DBD0FC",
      "text": "你知道吗？就算是相同的宝可梦，\\n也是有的孩子比较大，有的比较小哦。\\c\\n只要比较一下我的帕奇利兹们，\\n就一目了然了！\\c\\n我呀，只通过看就能非～常精确地\\n知道宝可梦的大小哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
